<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30540" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγχάσκω</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγχανοῦμαι</span>: aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγχανεῖν</span>:—lit., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>gape</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τὴν σελήνην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Icar.</u>
					13
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τῷ πλακοῦντι</span>
			<i>to gape for</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				1.22
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>grin</i> or <i>scoff at</i> one, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγχάσκειν σοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>V.</u>
					721
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσέχειν διαλεγομένψ καὶ ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Vit.</u>
					p.41
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Merc.Cond.</u>
				14
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ ᾽μῇ μωρίᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ichn.</u>
					343
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγχανεῖται ταῖς ἐμαῖς τύχαισι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ach.</u>
					1197
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγχανεῖται τῇ πόλει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					1313
				</span></i>
			: c. part., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὴ γὰρ
				ἐγχάνῃ ποτὲ . . ἐκφυγών</span>
			<i>let</i> him not <i>taunt</i> [us] <i>with</i> his having
			escaped, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				221
			</span></i>.</div>
